@startuml cu44
!theme plain
title CU44 — Modificar presupuesto

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) or receptionist (Recepcionista) looks up a budget.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (Budget number; First and last name; Identification type and number)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) or receptionist (Recepcionista) enters the data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Presents a list of budgets.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) or receptionist (Recepcionista) selects a budget.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows: (Name; Procedure; Items; Total; Notes)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) or receptionist (Recepcionista) modifies the data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Asks to calculate the new total.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Calculates the new total.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) confirms the changes.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the changes.
System -> System : System

@enduml